--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c092bb2c2768d4f45b5c037620df2532, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogo1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueTurnsList:
  - <Character>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 042e5873303a35541987377302458eb2, type: 2}
    dialogueLine: "You've fallen into the Abyss, a place where the forgotten, the
      broken, and the betrayed are cast away. The walls of this forsaken pit have
      seen the fall of many, their names lost to time, their bodies left to decay
      in the dark. This is no ordinary prison. This is where the damned are sent
      to fade into oblivion, never to return. But don\u2019t be fooled, stranger
      this place is not without its ruler. You\u2019re in Valthorr's domain now."
  - <Character>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 042e5873303a35541987377302458eb2, type: 2}
    dialogueLine: "Valthorr... He was once the chief of the suburbs, the lower quarters
      of Averon, where those too weak or too poor to survive in the city\u2019s light
      were left to rot. But that was before he was cast down, exiled like all of
      us. Now, he is known as Valthorr, the Abyss Plague. His very name strikes terror
      in the hearts of those who dwell here. He controls everything in this pit,
      and his power grows stronger with each passing day, feeding off the suffering
      of those trapped beneath the earth. There\u2019s no escape from his grasp."
  - <Character>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 042e5873303a35541987377302458eb2, type: 2}
    dialogueLine: "If you think you can escape, you\u2019re wrong. Valthorr rules
      this place with an iron fist, and his influence stretches to every corner of
      the Abyss. Those who challenge him, or even think to defy him, disappea reduced
      to dust, or worse, transformed into the horrors that roam these caves. You\u2019ll
      need more than luck if you want to survive here. Strength, cunning, and a willingness
      to embrace the darkness are your only allies now. But be warned, the deeper
      you go, the more you risk losing yourself to this cursed place."
